==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Assassin Bear]]s (100%) spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Assassin Bear]]s (100%) spawn after 53.53 seconds<sup>1,606f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] (1,000%) spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Likely the hardest stage out of the three, use [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark Cats]] to deal with the enemies in the stage.
Alternatively, if you have [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]], talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], you can safely clear the stage by syncing the two Bun Bun Blacks and finishing them off.

Start with two small freeze [[Cat Combo]]s or one medium one (e.g. [[Gross!!! (Combo)]]). Secondly equip the normal Cat Cannon. In battle, wait for the two Bun Bun Blacks to spawn and send out two Boulder Cats one after another, this should sync them. When the enemies get close, immediately spawn one Bombercat and talented Awakened Bahamut Cat. Finally don't forget to shoot the cannon when [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn. After the death of the Bun Buns the stage now has no serious threats.

